<p class="p3"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; font: 18.0px 'Helvetica Neue'; color: #0f6745; -webkit-text-stroke: #0f6745"><span class="s1"><b>Still Not Sure About Your Quote?</b></span></h2>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1">Reading a contractor quote takes experience. Even smart homeowners miss warning signs.</span></p>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1"><b>Ungouge.ai analyzes your quote against real market data:</b> - Line-by-line price comparison - Red flag identification - Regional cost adjustment - Fairness score with explanation</span></p>
