<p class="p3"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; font: 18.0px 'Helvetica Neue'; color: #0f6745; -webkit-text-stroke: #0f6745"><span class="s1"><b>What to Do If You Spot Red Flags</b></span></h2>
<ol class="ol1">
  <li class="li7"><span class="s3"><b></b></span><span class="s1"><b>Ask questions</b> — Sometimes there's a legitimate explanation</span></li>
  <li class="li7"><span class="s3"><b></b></span><span class="s1"><b>Get more quotes</b> — More data points = better decisions</span></li>
  <li class="li7"><span class="s3"><b></b></span><span class="s1"><b>Trust your gut</b> — If something feels off, it probably is</span></li>
  <li class="li7"><span class="s3"><b></b></span><span class="s1"><b>Walk away</b> — Better to keep looking than hire the wrong contractor</span></li>
</ol>
<p class="p3"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
